                                "sense_id": "13f28001-740d-35c8-a226-e5fbc93476b4",
                                "text": "Hermione, queen to the worthy Leontes, King of Sicilia, thou art here accused and arraigned of high treason"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "762ee5e0-7230-4077-8805-43ea7704d51e",
                                "sense_id": "13f28001-740d-35c8-a226-e5fbc93476b4",
                                "text": "“Are you sure that’s a real spell?” said the girl. “Well, it’s not very good, is it? I’ve tried a few simple spells just for practise and it’s all worked for me… I’m Hermione Granger, by the way, who are you?”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
